.\" Aileron man page
.\" Generated for v0.20.0
.TH AILERON "1" "May 2026" "aileron 0.20.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aileron \- keyboard-driven tiling web environment for developers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aileron
.RB [ \-d \fIconfig_dir\fR ] [ \-e \fIengine\fR ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Aileron is a keyboard-driven tiling web browser built in Rust. It renders
web content in tiled panes within a single window, inspired by terminal
multiplexers and tiling window managers. Uses wry (WebKitGTK) for web
rendering and egui for the UI overlay.
.PP
Features include:
.RS 4
.IP \(bu 2
BSP-tree tiling layout with horizontal/vertical splits
.IP \(bu 2
Vim-style modal editing (Normal, Insert, Command, Hint modes)
.IP \(bu 2
Command palette (Ctrl+P) with fuzzy search (Nucleo engine)
.IP \(bu 2
Integrated native terminal emulator (alacritty_terminal)
.IP \(bu 2
Lua scripting via init.lua
.IP \(bu 2
Bookmark management with folders and search
.IP \(bu 2
WebExtensions API (partial MV3: runtime, tabs, storage, scripting, webRequest, permissions)
.IP \(bu 2
MCP (Model Context Protocol) server for AI integration
.IP \(bu 2
Built-in ad blocking with EasyList-compatible filters ($redirect, $important, $badfilter)
.IP \(bu 2
HTTPS upgrade, tracking protection, DNT/GPC headers
.IP \(bu 2
Per-site settings (zoom, JavaScript, cookies, ad blocking, autoplay)
.IP \(bu 2
Download manager with progress tracking
.IP \(bu 2
ARP (Aileron Remote Protocol) for mobile clients
.IP \(bu 2
Sync protocol with delta detection and E2EE encryption (Age)
.IP \(bu 2
i18n support (9 languages: EN, ZH, JA, KO, DE, FR, ES, PT, RU)
.IP \(bu 2
Bitwarden password manager integration via keyring
.RE
.SH MODES
.B Normal mode (default):
Navigation, pane management, and command input.
Key bindings: h/j/k/l (scroll), J/K (tabs), d (close), Ctrl+w (vertical split), Ctrl+s (horizontal split).
.PP
.B Insert mode (i):
Pass keyboard input to web content.
Press Escape to return to Normal mode.
.PP
.B Command mode (:):
Type commands at the bottom of the screen.
Press Enter to execute, Escape to cancel.
.PP
.B Hint mode (f):
Reveal clickable link hints on all visible links.
Type hint digits to follow a link.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BR :open <url> " or " g<url>
Navigate to URL. g<url> opens in a new tab.
.TP
.BR :q , :quit
Quit Aileron.
.TP
.BR :vs , :sp
Split vertically / horizontally.
.TP
.BR :tab-next , :tab-prev
Next / previous tab (also J/K in normal mode).
.TP
.BR :tab-restore
Reopen last closed tab.
.TP
.BR :tab-rename <name>
Rename current tab.
.TP
.BR :tab-unload
Unload least-recently-used background pane to free memory.
.TP
.BR :tabs
Fuzzy search across open tabs.
.TP
.BR :gi
Enter insert mode.
.TP
.BR :private
Open a new private-browsing tab.
.TP
.BR :bookmarks
Open bookmarks panel.
.TP
.BR :bookmark <url> [folder]
Bookmark current page.
.TP
.BR :history
Browse history.
.TP
.BR :downloads
List active downloads.
.TP
.BR :find <query> " or " /<query>
Find in page (also Ctrl+f).
.TP
.BR :set <key> <value>
Set a configuration option.
.TP
.BR :site-settings
Open per-site settings panel.
.TP
.BR :stats
Show input latency statistics.
.TP
.BR :console
Show JavaScript console log.
.TP
.BR :inspect " or " F12
Toggle WebKit developer tools.
.TP
.BR :mute , :unmute
Toggle audio mute on current pane.
.TP
.BR :adblock-toggle
Toggle ad blocking for current site.
.TP
.BR :adblock-update
Update ad block filter lists.
.TP
.BR :crash-reload
Reload pane after a crash.
.TP
.BR :ws-save <name> , :ws-load <name>
Save / load workspace.
.TP
.BR :ws-next , :ws-prev
Cycle through workspaces.
.TP
.BR :zoom-in , :zoom-out , :zoom-reset
Adjust page zoom level (also Ctrl+=/Ctrl+-/Ctrl+0).
.TP
.BR :theme <name>
Switch color theme.
.TP
.BR :language <code>
Switch UI language (en, zh, ja, ko, de, fr, es, pt, ru).
.TP
.BR :language-list
List available languages.
.TP
.BR :engine auto|servo|webkit
Select rendering engine.
.TP
.BR :bind <key> <action> " , " :unbind <key>
Customize keybindings.
.TP
.BR :extension-load <path>
Load a WebExtensions extension.
.TP
.BR :lua <code>
Execute Lua code.
.TP
.BR :yt <query>
Search YouTube.
.SH KEY BINDINGS
Normal mode defaults:
.TP
.BR h / j / k / l
Scroll left / down / up / right.
.TP
.BR J / K
Next / previous tab.
.TP
.BR d
Close current pane.
.TP
.BR D
Close current pane, focus left.
.TP
.BR Ctrl+w
Split vertically.
.TP
.BR Ctrl+s
Split horizontally.
.TP
.BR H / Shift+J / Shift+K / L
Resize split (increase left/down/up/right).
.TP
.BR r
Reload current pane.
.TP
.BR i
Enter insert mode.
.TP
.BR :
Enter command mode.
.TP
.BR Ctrl+p
Open command palette.
.TP
.BR Ctrl+h
Toggle bookmarks panel.
.TP
.BR f
Open link hints (F opens in new tab).
.TP
.BR y
Copy current URL to clipboard.
.TP
.BR p
Paste from clipboard and navigate.
.TP
.BR u
Reopen last closed tab.
.TP
.BR /
Search in page.
.TP
.BR n / N
Next / previous search match.
.TP
.BR Ctrl+f
Open find bar.
.TP
.BR Ctrl+d / Ctrl+u
Half page down / up.
.TP
.BR gg / G
Scroll to top / bottom.
.TP
.BR Ctrl+t
Open new tab.
.TP
.BR Ctrl+b
Toggle bookmark on current page.
.TP
.BR F12
Toggle developer tools.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-d \fIconfig_dir\fR
Use custom configuration directory (default: ~/.config/aileron/).
.TP
.BR \-e \fIengine\fR
Select rendering engine: webkit (default) or servo (experimental).
.SH FILES
.TP
.IR ~/.config/aileron/config.toml
User configuration file (homepage, search engine, keybindings, themes, etc.).
.TP
.IR ~/.config/aileron/aileron.db
SQLite database (history, bookmarks, sessions, site settings).
.TP
.IR ~/.config/aileron/workspaces/
Saved workspace files.
.TP
.IR ~/.local/share/aileron/
Downloads directory.
.TP
.IR ~/.config/aileron/init.lua
Lua scripting configuration.
.TP
.IR ~/.config/aileron/extensions/
Installed WebExtensions.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Configuration is stored in TOML format. Key options:
.TP
.BR homepage
Default new-tab URL.
.TP
.BR search_engine
Default search engine URL template ({query} placeholder).
.TP
.BR [keybindings]
Custom keybinding overrides (e.g., "<C-t>" = "new_tab").
.TP
.BR popup_blocker_enabled
Block window.open() popups (default: true).
.TP
.BR https_upgrade_enabled
Upgrade HTTP to HTTPS (default: true).
.TP
.BR tracking_protection_enabled
Enable tracking protection (default: true).
.TP
.BR restore_session
Restore tabs on startup (default: true).
.TP
.BR adaptive_quality
Reduce frame rate for background tabs (default: true).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.BR AILERON_TESTING
Set to 1 to disable GPU/rendering requirements (for CI/testing).
.TP
.BR RUST_LOG
Logging verbosity (e.g., info, debug, trace).
